[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:Do the English Speak English?]
[00:00.90]Do they speak English? | 他们说英语吗？
[00:09.72]Why does the writer not understand the porter? | 为什么作者听不懂搬运工的话？
[00:16.94]I arrived in London at last. | 我终于抵达伦敦了。
[00:20.74]The railway station was big, black and dark. | 火车站又大，又黑，又暗。
[00:25.96]I did not know the way to my hotel, so I asked a porter. | 我不知道去旅馆的路，所以我问了一位搬运工。
[00:32.14]I not only spoke English very carefully, but very clearly as well. | 我不仅非常仔细地说英语，而且说得非常清楚。
[00:39.61]The porter, however, could not understand me. | 然而，那个搬运工却听不懂我。
[00:44.00]I repeated my question several times and at last he understood. | 我重复了我的问题好几次，最后他终于明白了。
[00:50.94]he answered me, but he spoke neither slowly nor clearly. | 他回答了我，但他既说得不慢也不清楚。
[00:56.80]'I am a foreigner,' I said. | “我是一个外国人，”我说。
[01:00.83]Then he spoke slowly, but I could not understand him. | 然后他慢慢地说，但我仍然听不懂他。
[01:06.62]My teacher never spoke English like that! | 我的老师从来没有那样说过英语！
[01:11.26]The porter and I looked at each other and smiled. | 搬运工和我互相对视，然后笑了。
[01:15.52]Then he said something and I understood it. | 然后他说了一些话，我听懂了。
[01:19.58]'You'll soon learn English!' he said. | “你很快就会学好英语的！”他说。
[01:23.87]I wonder. | 我怀疑。
[01:26.00]In England, each person speaks a different language. | 在英国，每个人都说着不同的语言。
[01:31.04]The English understand each other, but I don't understand them! | 英国人彼此听得懂，但我听不懂他们！